			"notes": "# Rockified - v1.0.0\n\n> Rock and stone !\n\n- Breaking a block partially made of stone, such as an iron ore, will drop an additional cobblestone block.\n- Breaking a block partially made of deepslate, such as a deepslate iron ore, will drop an additional cobbled deepslate block.\n- Breaking a block partially made of netherrack, such as a nether quartz ore, will drop an additional netherrack block.\n\n*BIsous*."
